{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:06 2026-11-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:06 2026-11-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:06 2026-11-12 HKT</p><img alt=\"跨部門「火石」掃黃拘21內地女 年紀最大73歲\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/daecfb1aed856bf2e93b0c8d69af4f0b/2026-11/20261112_NEWS_yl.png\"/><p>元朗警區特別職務隊聯同入境事務處人員昨日（11日）於區內展開代號「火石」（FLINTSTONE）行動，打擊非法賣淫活動。行動中，人員以涉嫌「違反逗留條件」，共拘捕21名內地女子（介乎18至73歲）。</p><p>據了解，被捕年紀最大的73歲女子，在案中角色亦涉及賣淫，所有被捕人正被扣留調查。警方強調，元朗警區會繼續加大力度，打擊區內賣淫等非法活動，並呼籲市民若發現區內有懷疑非法活動，應與警方聯絡。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f5febbf41b08067d1dcc88adb1852039/2026-11/1_14_28.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45151657a822e8b394513db906a84f01/2026-11/2_2_49.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T01:27:17.626671+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T00:06:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:00:51.600393+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T01:20:35.942134+00:00","content_hash":"1e62ab8a43fbfa60fb1a2b1e2777dacb5ea7985bea2c6219c2d16e002d9c7bb5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}